flowchart TD
  A["Profile suggests a rule,<br/>or you write one"] --> B["Try it before saving:<br/>see the failing rows"]
  B --> C["Save, with thresholds:<br/>Warn above, Fail above"]
  C --> D["Runs after every scan,<br/>or with Run rules now"]
  D --> E{"Result"}
  E -- Pass --> F["Score in its dimension =<br/>share of rows that passed"]
  E -- "Warning, Fail or<br/>Could not run" --> G["Task in the issue list,<br/>notification, webhook"]
  G --> D
  F --> D
